  "details": "I want to use one set of Contact Sender+Receiver to trigger multiple different animations depending on a setting.\n\nThe use case for this is Sync Emotes.\n\nCurrently if you want 10 sync emotes, you need a separate sender+receiver for each separate emote.\n\nIf it had some kind of variable integer I could animate or control in a behavior so that it knows to do something different for the same contact. maybe with different parameters or parameter values, this could be broken down to 1 pair.",
